# The mod's scripts and command config files are parsed/executed by the
# console's BusyBox shell and this project's own line-based parsers, neither
# of which tolerate CRLF (a stray \r ends up embedded in paths/values,
# e.g. COMMAND_STR=sh %script_dir%/om_network\r causes "No such file").
# Force LF regardless of platform checkout settings (core.autocrlf, etc.).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.xz binary
*.hmod binary
